## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Length & Scene Standards**:
> - A standard Korean web novel chapter is **4,500 – 5,500 characters** (공백 포함 4,500~5,500자).
> - We calibrate the Director to produce **3 to 4 well-developed scenes** per episode, and calibrate the Writer to output **1,200 to 1,500 Korean characters per scene**.

> [!NOTE]
> **Episode Model Schema**:
> - We add `summary: str = ""` to `Episode` in `src/storyweaver/models/episode.py` and `frontend/src/types/storyweaver.ts`.
> - This ensures summaries are visible, editable by the author, and persist directly inside `data/project.json`.

